{"parentUuid":"a80d86a9-7858-4b6a-89f5-93eb5c5055ea","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CeLy533PNgPChXDXghmhd","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Clippy is running in the background (it's a slow full-workspace all-features pass). While it runs, let me give you a status summary of where the combined PR stands.\n\n## PR #577 — status\n\nAll five features are implemented, tested, and committed on `feat/bigquery-auto-create-table` (the BigQuery commit is already pushed; the other four + schema sync are local, pending the gate run):\n\n| Commit | Feature | Tests |\n|---|---|---|\n| BigQuery auto-create | table+dataset created on first sync (missing **and** schemaless), all write paths | 68 unit + wiremock (create/recreate/skip/disabled) ✅ |\n| **#569** | graphql offset-into-query-string for ShopifyQL | wiremock paging ✅ |\n| **#573** | `${map:}` computed-param interpolation | 9 unit + spec validation ✅ |\n| **#568** | `set` a column from `${parent.*}`/`${now.*}` | expand + e2e fan-out ✅ |\n| **#567** | flow-captured value into a raw XML/text body | xml wiremock + flow + expand ✅ |\n\nEach landed as its own commit with unit + integration tests; `schemas/faucet.schema.json` synced for the new config fields; docs updated (auth cookbook, config reference). Issues filed and linked: **#578** (BigQuery auto-create) and **#580** (the cross-sink auto-create follow-up you asked me to file, to tackle later).\n\n**Remaining before I push + arm auto-merge:**\n1. Workspace clippy `--all-features` (running now).\n2. `cargo-semver-checks` on `faucet-core` (required CI gate — I added a `captured` field to the `#[non_exhaustive]` `RequestAuth`, which is a minor/non-breaking change, but I'll verify).\n3. The three slim CLI builds + `cargo doc`.\n\nI'll report the moment clippy finishes and continue driving to a green, merged PR."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":566,"cache_read_input_tokens":691406,"output_tokens":657,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":566,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":657,"cache_read_input_tokens":691406,"cache_creation_input_tokens":566,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":566},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeLy4zbJNe6XYdW1wYM5b","type":"assistant","uuid":"da1cae8e-fb68-43dc-a151-7e7786f2f34f","timestamp":"2026-08-24T04:47:42.940Z","effort":"high","session_id":"55398c64-7c65-40db-9b68-886111a86d7f","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/c-sikawats/Documents/GitHub/Personal/faucet-stream","sessionId":"55398c64-7c65-40db-9b68-886111a86d7f","version":"2.1.228","gitBranch":"feat/bigquery-auto-create-table","slug":"linear-noodling-leaf"}
