{"parentUuid":"a7bf9d5a-ed64-4a64-8642-d61c18547fcb","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CeM1g9Ls7J8movayzpTx1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Auto-merge is **armed** (state OPEN, BLOCKED pending the ~25-min required checks — it'll land automatically once green). Let me record the push-credential workaround for future sessions."}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":793,"cache_read_input_tokens":733778,"output_tokens":1330,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":314},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":793,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1330,"cache_read_input_tokens":733778,"cache_creation_input_tokens":793,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":793},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeM1g73hTyjBBk2fs83xc","type":"assistant","uuid":"af4ca7e6-227d-4a53-a84d-4e44d2f77124","timestamp":"2026-08-24T05:21:49.607Z","effort":"high","session_id":"55398c64-7c65-40db-9b68-886111a86d7f","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/c-sikawats/Documents/GitHub/Personal/faucet-stream","sessionId":"55398c64-7c65-40db-9b68-886111a86d7f","version":"2.1.228","gitBranch":"feat/bigquery-auto-create-table","slug":"linear-noodling-leaf"}
{"parentUuid":"af4ca7e6-227d-4a53-a84d-4e44d2f77124","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CeM1g9Ls7J8movayzpTx1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_0148qr6b63vXXMrhCeUCkBd1","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/c-sikawats/.claude/projects/-Users-c-sikawats-Documents-GitHub-Personal-faucet-stream/memory/reference_git_push_stall_and_credential_fix.md","content":"---\nname: reference_git_push_stall_and_credential_fix\ndescription: git push in this sandbox stalls/fails on creds; fix = inline gh token helper; background pushes get culled\nmetadata:\n  type: reference\n---\n\n`git push` to github from this sandbox is unreliable in two distinct ways:\n\n1. **Credential failure (fast):** `fatal: could not read Username … terminal prompts disabled` / `User cancelled dialog`. Two helpers are configured — gh (`!gh auth git-credential`) AND GCM (`git-credential-manager`); GCM's GUI prompt auto-cancels non-interactively. `gh auth setup-git` alone does NOT reliably fix it. **Working fix — feed the gh token inline, bypassing both helpers:**\n   ```\n   gh auth switch --user PawanSikawat\n   TOKEN=$(gh auth token)\n   git -c credential.helper= \\\n       -c \"credential.helper=!f() { echo username=PawanSikawat; echo password=$TOKEN; }; f\" \\\n       -c http.version=HTTP/1.1 \\\n       push origin <branch>\n   ```\n2. **Transfer stall (slow):** even with creds OK, the HTTPS transfer often hangs for minutes; `-c http.version=HTTP/1.1` helps. A push that the client reports as timed-out/killed frequently **still lands server-side** — always re-check the real remote SHA with `gh api repos/faucet-hq/faucet-stream/branches/<branch> --jq .commit.sha` (or `git ls-remote`) before retrying.\n\n**Background pushes get culled:** `run_in_background: true` git pushes are killed (\"stopped\") — any subsequent Bash/Monitor poll appears to cull them. Run the push in the **foreground** with a large `timeout` (e.g. 540000ms) instead.\n\nThere is also a git wrapper that prints `[entire] Pushing N checkpoint ref(s) … done` and can rewrite the pushed commit SHA (remote SHA ≠ local SHA even for identical content) — so a branch can look \"diverged\" (`merge-base --is-ancestor` false) after a wrapper push + a local `--amend`; reconcile with `--force-with-lease=<ref>:<remote-sha>` (verify remote content first via `gh api .../compare/main...<sha>`). See [[reference_gh_auth_and_git_add_gotchas]].\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":793,"cache_read_input_tokens":733778,"output_tokens":1330,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":314},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":793,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1330,"cache_read_input_tokens":733778,"cache_creation_input_tokens":793,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":793},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeM1g73hTyjBBk2fs83xc","type":"assistant","uuid":"ed725cf4-3548-4217-bebf-bce0aebb8793","timestamp":"2026-08-24T05:22:02.402Z","effort":"high","session_id":"55398c64-7c65-40db-9b68-886111a86d7f","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/c-sikawats/Documents/GitHub/Personal/faucet-stream","sessionId":"55398c64-7c65-40db-9b68-886111a86d7f","version":"2.1.228","gitBranch":"feat/bigquery-auto-create-table","slug":"linear-noodling-leaf"}
{"parentUuid":"ed725cf4-3548-4217-bebf-bce0aebb8793","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"44593253-6ae0-4c5c-bede-0f4720f09c7e","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0148qr6b63vXXMrhCeUCkBd1","type":"tool_result","content":"File created successfully at: /Users/c-sikawats/.claude/projects/-Users-c-sikawats-Documents-GitHub-Personal-faucet-stream/memory/reference_git_push_stall_and_credential_fix.md"}]},"uuid":"5c66a07e-8298-4a24-830f-0db6111ae483","timestamp":"2026-08-24T05:22:02.787Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"create","filePath":"/Users/c-sikawats/.claude/projects/-Users-c-sikawats-Documents-GitHub-Personal-faucet-stream/memory/reference_git_push_stall_and_credential_fix.md","content":"---\nname: reference_git_push_stall_and_credential_fix\ndescription: git push in this sandbox stalls/fails on creds; fix = inline gh token helper; background pushes get culled\nmetadata: \n  node_type: memory\n  type: reference\n  originSessionId: 55398c64-7c65-40db-9b68-886111a86d7f\n  modified: 2026-08-24T05:22:02.436Z\n---\n\n`git push` to github from this sandbox is unreliable in two distinct ways:\n\n1. **Credential failure (fast):** `fatal: could not read Username … terminal prompts disabled` / `User cancelled dialog`. Two helpers are configured — gh (`!gh auth git-credential`) AND GCM (`git-credential-manager`); GCM's GUI prompt auto-cancels non-interactively. `gh auth setup-git` alone does NOT reliably fix it. **Working fix — feed the gh token inline, bypassing both helpers:**\n   ```\n   gh auth switch --user PawanSikawat\n   TOKEN=$(gh auth token)\n   git -c credential.helper= \\\n       -c \"credential.helper=!f() { echo username=PawanSikawat; echo password=$TOKEN; }; f\" \\\n       -c http.version=HTTP/1.1 \\\n       push origin <branch>\n   ```\n2. **Transfer stall (slow):** even with creds OK, the HTTPS transfer often hangs for minutes; `-c http.version=HTTP/1.1` helps. A push that the client reports as timed-out/killed frequently **still lands server-side** — always re-check the real remote SHA with `gh api repos/faucet-hq/faucet-stream/branches/<branch> --jq .commit.sha` (or `git ls-remote`) before retrying.\n\n**Background pushes get culled:** `run_in_background: true` git pushes are killed (\"stopped\") — any subsequent Bash/Monitor poll appears to cull them. Run the push in the **foreground** with a large `timeout` (e.g. 540000ms) instead.\n\nThere is also a git wrapper that prints `[entire] Pushing N checkpoint ref(s) … done` and can rewrite the pushed commit SHA (remote SHA ≠ local SHA even for identical content) — so a branch can look \"diverged\" (`merge-base --is-ancestor` false) after a wrapper push + a local `--amend`; reconcile with `--force-with-lease=<ref>:<remote-sha>` (verify remote content first via `gh api .../compare/main...<sha>`). See [[reference_gh_auth_and_git_add_gotchas]].\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false,"memdirStamped":true},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"ed725cf4-3548-4217-bebf-bce0aebb8793","session_id":"55398c64-7c65-40db-9b68-886111a86d7f","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/c-sikawats/Documents/GitHub/Personal/faucet-stream","sessionId":"55398c64-7c65-40db-9b68-886111a86d7f","version":"2.1.228","gitBranch":"feat/bigquery-auto-create-table","slug":"linear-noodling-leaf"}
